<title>ESTONIA: MERKO SHARES TO BE TRADED UNDER ONE NAME.</title>
<headline>MERKO SHARES TO BE TRADED UNDER ONE NAME.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>All trading in Merko construction company shares from August 1 will be under one name, the Tallinn stock exchange said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The exchange said in a statement all 2.95 million shares will be traded under the name &quot;Merko&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9202 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
